#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:5
msgid "ブラベー格子と結晶系"
msgstr "Bravais Lattices and Crystal Systems"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:7
msgid ""
"格子を対称性で分類した14のブラベー格子型と、格子系・結晶系の関係を整理する。続く7つの節では、 "
"結晶系ごとに、そこに現れる格子の慣用単位胞を3次元の図で示す。"
msgstr ""
"We review the 14 Bravais lattice types, which classify lattices by "
"symmetry, and the relationship between lattice systems and crystal "
"systems. The next seven sections show three-dimensional views of the "
"conventional cells of the lattices that occur in each crystal system."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:10
msgid ""
"**前提知識**: :ref:`基本並進ベクトル<lattice-translations>`、:ref:`格子定数<lattice-"
"metric>`、 :ref:`慣用単位胞<lattice-unit-cells>`、:ref:`中心並進<centring-"
"translation>`。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: :ref:`primitive translation vectors <lattice-"
"translations>`, :ref:`lattice constants <lattice-metric>`, "
":ref:`conventional cells <lattice-unit-cells>`, and :ref:`centering "
"translations <centring-translation>`."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:13
msgid "**学習目標**:"
msgstr "**Learning objectives**:"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:15
msgid "ブラベー格子型が格子の何を分類したものかを説明し、14の型を格子系と中心並進の記号（P、I、F、C、R）で読む。"
msgstr ""
"Explain what Bravais lattice types classify and identify the 14 types "
"from the lattice system and the symbol for the centering translations (P,"
" I, F, C, R)."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:16
msgid "格子系と結晶系の違いを、三方晶系に菱面体格子と六方格子の両方が現れる例で説明する。"
msgstr ""
"Explain the difference between lattice systems and crystal systems using "
"the trigonal crystal system, in which both rhombohedral and hexagonal "
"lattices occur."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:21
msgid "格子の分類"
msgstr "Classification of Lattices"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:23
msgid ""
"格子は、\\ :ref:`基本並進ベクトル<lattice-translations>`\\ の長さや角度（\\ :ref:`格子定数"
"<lattice-metric>`）を連続的に変えれば無数に作れる。 これらを、格子が持つ対称性（格子点の集合を自分自身に重ねる回転・鏡映と、 "
":ref:`慣用単位胞<lattice-unit-cells>`\\ の\\ :ref:`中心並進<centring-"
"translation>`\\ の種類）によって分類したものが "
"ブラベー（Bravais）格子型であり、3次元では14種類ある。14は格子の個数ではなく型の数である。 "
"格子に置いた原子の配置まで含めた対称性は、結晶の\\ :ref:`空間群<crystal-space-group>`\\ で表す。"
msgstr ""
"Infinitely many lattices can be made by continuously varying the lengths "
"and angles of the \\ :ref:`primitive translation vectors <lattice-"
"translations>`\\ , which are the \\ :ref:`lattice constants <lattice-"
"metric>`. Bravais lattice types classify those lattices by symmetry: the "
"rotations and reflections that map the set of lattice points onto itself,"
" and the ways the :ref:`conventional cell <lattice-unit-cells>`\\  is "
"centered by \\ :ref:`centering translations <centring-translation>`\\ . "
"There are 14 types in three dimensions. Fourteen is the number of types, "
"not the number of lattices. The crystal's \\ :ref:`space group <crystal-"
"space-group>`\\  describes its symmetry including the arrangement of "
"atoms on the lattice."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:29
msgid ""
"表の行は格子系、後の図を載せた節の見出しは、原子配置の対称性をもとにした結晶系である。 "
"多くは一対一に対応するが、菱面体格子系・六方格子系と三方晶系・六方晶系の組では、 一つの結晶系に複数の格子系が現れる。"
msgstr ""
"The table rows list lattice systems, whereas the headings above the "
"figures below name crystal systems, which are based on the symmetry of "
"the atomic arrangement. Most correspond one-to-one. The relationship "
"between the rhombohedral and hexagonal lattice systems and the trigonal "
"crystal system and hexagonal crystal system is an exception: a single "
"crystal system can have more than one lattice system."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:33
msgid "3次元の14ブラベー格子型"
msgstr "The 14 Bravais lattice types in three dimensions"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:36
msgid "格子系"
msgstr "Lattice system"

