msgstr "14"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:64
msgid ""
"記号は慣用単位胞の中心並進の種類を表す。Pは単純（中心並進なし、格子点1個）、Iは体心（2個）、Fは面心（4個）、Cは1組の向かい合う面の中心に格子点を持つ底心（2個。軸の選び方によりA、Bとも書く）である。Rは菱面体格子で、基本単位胞は菱面体、\\"
" :ref:`六方軸の慣用単位胞<lt-rhombohedral-hexagonal>`\\ では格子点3個を含む。"
msgstr ""
"The symbols denote the kinds of centering translations of the "
"conventional cell. P is primitive (no centering translation, one lattice "
"point), I is body-centered (two lattice points), and F is face-centered "
"(four lattice points). C is base-centered, with lattice points at the "
"centers of one pair of opposite faces and two lattice points per cell. It"
" is also written A or B, depending on the choice of axes. R denotes the "
"rhombohedral lattice. Its primitive cell is a rhombohedron, and its \\ "
":ref:`conventional cell with hexagonal axes <lt-rhombohedral-"
"hexagonal>`\\  contains three lattice points."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:66
msgid "菱面体格子（R）を持つ結晶は三方晶系に属する。三方晶系には、α石英のように六方格子（P）を 持つ結晶もある。六方晶系の結晶の格子は六方Pである。"
msgstr ""
"Crystals with a rhombohedral lattice (R) belong to the trigonal crystal "
"system. The trigonal crystal system also includes crystals with a "
"hexagonal lattice (P), such as α-quartz. Crystals in the hexagonal "
"crystal system have hexagonal P lattices."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:71
msgid "三斜晶系"
msgstr "Triclinic Crystal System"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:73
msgid "三斜格子（P）を含む。"
msgstr "This system includes the triclinic lattice (P)."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:86
msgid "単斜晶系"
msgstr "Monoclinic Crystal System"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:88
msgid "単純単斜格子、底心単斜格子を含む。"
msgstr "This system includes primitive and base-centered monoclinic lattices."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:101
msgid "直方晶系"
msgstr "Orthorhombic Crystal System"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:103
msgid "斜方晶系と呼ばれることもある。単純直方格子、体心直方格子、面心直方格子、底心直方格子を含む。"
msgstr ""
"This system includes primitive, body-centered, face-centered, and base-"
"centered orthorhombic lattices."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:116
msgid "正方晶系"
msgstr "Tetragonal Crystal System"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:118
msgid "単純正方格子、体心正方格子を含む。"
msgstr "This system includes primitive and body-centered tetragonal lattices."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:131
msgid "三方晶系"
msgstr "Trigonal Crystal System"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:133
msgid "菱面体格子（rhombohedral lattice、R）を含む。三方晶系の結晶には、六方格子（P）を持つものもある。"
msgstr ""
"This system includes the rhombohedral lattice (R). Some crystals in the "
"trigonal crystal system have a hexagonal lattice (P)."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:146
msgid "六方晶系"
msgstr "Hexagonal Crystal System"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:148
msgid "六方格子（P）を含む。"
msgstr "This system includes the hexagonal lattice (P)."

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:161
msgid "立方晶系"
msgstr "Cubic Crystal System"

#: ../../solid/unitcell.rst:163
msgid "単純立方格子、体心立方格子、面心立方格子を含む。"
msgstr ""
"This system includes simple cubic, body-centered cubic, and face-centered"
" cubic lattices."

